	{{APP_ID}}
	{{NAME}} integration
	{{SUMMARY}}
	{{DESCRIPTION}}

{{NAME}} runs entirely in your browser as WebAssembly. Files go only between your browser and your Nextcloud, and the server needs no extra software.

This is a community integration based on [{{NAME}}](https://github.com/storytold/{{ID}}) by the ArtCraft team, an open-source, Rust-native {{KIND}}. It embeds a build of {{NAME}} and is not made or endorsed by the ArtCraft team.

**Requirements:** a browser with WebGPU or WebGL2, and a web server that serves `.wasm` files as `application/wasm` (Nextcloud's own Apache and nginx configurations do).
